WEBVTT

00:15.070 --> 00:18.610
<i>My tears scattered like bits of paper</i>

00:18.610 --> 00:22.320
<i>Scared of the unknowable tomorrow</i>

00:22.320 --> 00:25.840
<i>I lived the same day over and over,
 back and forth</i>

00:25.840 --> 00:29.670
<i>But a new morning never came</i>

00:29.670 --> 00:31.920
<i>All the reasons to calm down</i>

00:31.920 --> 00:36.350
<i>Are just some moments until the crash</i>

00:36.870 --> 00:39.850
<i>I'm no longer the one that everyone knows</i>

00:39.850 --> 00:44.150
<i>Took off the fragile armor</i>

00:44.150 --> 00:51.220
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

00:51.640 --> 00:58.700
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

00:58.700 --> 01:02.390
<i>There's still no line 
between today and tomorrow</i>

01:02.390 --> 01:05.960
<i>My waking nightmare doesn't end</i>

01:05.960 --> 01:09.590
<i>And yet I won't lose hope</i>

01:09.590 --> 01:15.640
<i>And yet there's no night that doesn't end</i>

01:15.640 --> 01:27.980
<i>Not here, not here</i>

01:45.510 --> 01:46.960
Undertaker!

01:46.960 --> 01:48.540
Where's Vash?

01:49.760 --> 01:52.430
That's none of my business anymore.

01:52.430 --> 01:53.190
Huh?

01:55.980 --> 01:57.630
Stop playing around.

01:57.630 --> 01:58.220
What?

01:58.220 --> 02:00.530
Where is Vash?

02:00.530 --> 02:02.610
I'm tellin' you, I don't know.

02:02.610 --> 02:05.250
Maybe Knives is turning him 
into a mummy or something.

02:09.540 --> 02:10.560
What was that for?

02:10.560 --> 02:12.260
I'm so disappointed in you.

02:12.260 --> 02:13.690
Huh?

02:15.520 --> 02:17.320
Who does she think she is?

02:31.470 --> 02:33.250
Don't panic, Vash.

02:48.060 --> 02:50.630
Now, let's begin.

02:56.420 --> 02:58.770
Initial connection complete.

02:58.770 --> 03:03.230
Vitals are stable. 
Looks like the connection was a success.

03:03.230 --> 03:08.200
At last, a hundred years 
of my research bears fruit...

03:11.540 --> 03:12.630
Stop this.

03:13.620 --> 03:14.670
I mean it.

03:15.960 --> 03:17.780
You won't shoot me.

03:19.740 --> 03:22.180
It's bulletproof glass. Besides...

03:22.180 --> 03:25.970
Forcefully severing the 
connection now would be fatal.

03:27.900 --> 03:29.100
What are you trying to do?

03:30.710 --> 03:35.130
The plants are just husks.

03:35.660 --> 03:39.520
Their true being is located elsewhere.

03:39.520 --> 03:44.020
Not here, but an alternate dimension.
A higher plane.

03:45.400 --> 03:51.770
That's where the energy 
we consume from plants originates.

03:52.470 --> 03:57.540
Plants are merely windows that 
connect the two dimensions.

03:57.540 --> 03:59.360
So what do you want?!

03:59.360 --> 04:03.630
Why do you think the twins are 
the only ones with their own will?

04:04.470 --> 04:10.020
I hypothesize that the key difference 
between the plants and Independents

04:10.020 --> 04:11.900
is the existence of a soul.

04:12.430 --> 04:17.110
In order to give the plants souls, 
we must connect to the core.

04:17.110 --> 04:18.630
What core?

04:18.630 --> 04:21.030
The manifestation of the
 beginning and the end.

04:21.030 --> 04:24.920
The source of all matter and energy.

04:24.920 --> 04:29.200
Access the core. Give plants souls.

04:29.200 --> 04:30.910
That is my objective.

04:30.910 --> 04:35.830
Are you saying... you intend to make every 
plant on this planet an Independent?

04:46.630 --> 04:48.040
This place...

04:48.890 --> 04:52.180
Curious this is the first memory I come to.

04:53.460 --> 04:55.040
What do you mean?

04:55.040 --> 04:57.660
Do you remember what I vowed that day?

04:59.610 --> 05:03.680
I've done it. I found the way to free them.

05:04.580 --> 05:06.740
To make it happen, I need your help.

05:06.740 --> 05:09.640
Come. Let us save our brethren together.

05:11.750 --> 05:14.330
You know why humans abuse plants?

05:14.330 --> 05:17.010
Because they crashed on this barren planet.

05:17.010 --> 05:18.710
It's our fault!

05:19.530 --> 05:20.930
I see.

05:22.590 --> 05:27.550
Then be crucified on behalf 
of the Sinners, as you wish!

05:35.480 --> 05:39.690
If all the plants become Independent, 
humanity won't survive!

05:40.300 --> 05:44.920
We're already in the process 
of a slow suicide.

05:44.920 --> 05:48.760
Plant Independence is the
 only way to reverse that.

05:49.250 --> 05:50.890
Vash's "window" is special.

05:50.890 --> 05:55.210
He's the only one able to take from 
<i>and</i> send to the higher dimension.

05:55.210 --> 05:58.470
He'd never agree to something like this!

05:58.470 --> 06:00.540
That is why he shall be remade.

06:00.960 --> 06:03.020
"Remade"?

06:05.890 --> 06:08.040
Second connection successful.

06:08.450 --> 06:13.110
We can now interfere with 
every plant using Vash as a window.

06:13.110 --> 06:15.100
This is the point of no return.

06:18.520 --> 06:20.770
Vash! Snap out of it!

06:21.190 --> 06:22.580
Vash!

06:24.170 --> 06:29.290
Initializing assimilation, absorption, 
awakening, and memory manipulation.

06:29.290 --> 06:31.220
Memory manipulation?

06:31.220 --> 06:32.450
Knives.

06:32.450 --> 06:38.000
It's going well. I'm heading deeper now.

06:38.630 --> 06:41.340
Soon, you won't recognize anything.

06:41.340 --> 06:44.840
Not me, not the world...

06:46.710 --> 06:48.030
Nothing.

06:50.470 --> 06:51.800
I owe you one.

07:00.130 --> 07:02.970
<i>Gotta make a choice, huh?</i>

07:10.300 --> 07:12.280
Leave this town!

07:14.700 --> 07:17.090
You said you'd save us.

07:17.090 --> 07:18.080
Tonis...

07:19.130 --> 07:21.210
You said you'd save us.

07:22.060 --> 07:23.070
Rollo!

07:30.260 --> 07:33.430
You want us to live on, 
even if it's as monsters?

07:35.010 --> 07:40.940
How could you be so irresponsible? 
You can't even take care of us.

07:42.030 --> 07:44.100
Kill him. Put him out of his misery.

07:45.690 --> 07:47.600
Kill...

07:48.340 --> 07:49.280
Kill...!

07:49.280 --> 07:51.070
No, Rollo.

07:52.570 --> 07:54.160
That's enough!

08:07.050 --> 08:10.210
You're no hero who'll save everyone.

08:11.190 --> 08:16.240
You're just a coward who can't 
stand to watch anyone die.

08:19.660 --> 08:21.840
Where am I?

08:22.570 --> 08:23.690
My hand...

08:26.090 --> 08:30.050
This isn't real! 
It's a dream you're showing me...

08:30.050 --> 08:31.300
It's fake!

08:41.830 --> 08:44.510
I have to get out of here.

08:50.690 --> 08:52.390
I have to find the exit.

08:57.380 --> 09:00.600
Synchronization at 40 percent and climbing.

09:00.600 --> 09:03.600
I won't let you get away, Vash.

09:26.780 --> 09:28.450
This is...

09:28.450 --> 09:31.330
That's right. It's the Big Fall.

09:33.670 --> 09:37.090
What will they think once
 they learn it was your fault?

09:41.890 --> 09:43.670
Don't you worry.

09:44.560 --> 09:49.810
They're just feeble creatures 
that don't even live for a century.

09:49.810 --> 09:51.270
Now forget.

09:51.970 --> 09:53.780
Let go and relax.

09:59.460 --> 10:01.610
Who were they again...?

10:06.330 --> 10:08.570
Synchronization at 70 percent.

10:08.570 --> 10:11.840
Seventy, eighty... What speed!

10:20.610 --> 10:22.000
What's going on?

10:26.810 --> 10:29.570
These are... They're like the flora!

10:30.690 --> 10:32.940
What is this, Knives?

10:32.940 --> 10:34.740
Don't panic.

10:54.590 --> 10:59.130
Release your powers, Vash! 
Let's remake the world!

11:15.980 --> 11:18.670
Synchronization at 90 percent...

11:20.140 --> 11:22.950
Progress has stalled?

11:44.020 --> 11:45.220
That woman...

11:46.090 --> 11:47.220
There you are!

11:49.670 --> 11:51.720
Rem Saverem!

11:54.790 --> 11:56.980
Love for humanity versus...

11:58.350 --> 12:00.300
love for a younger brother.

12:05.570 --> 12:08.550
It will determine the fate of the world.

12:14.100 --> 12:17.000
Quite an appetite you've got there.
 You on your way home?

12:17.000 --> 12:17.980
Nope.

12:17.980 --> 12:19.350
I see.

12:19.350 --> 12:23.550
Haven't you heard? The Humanoid 
Typhoon snuck into the city.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.740
What? No way.

12:25.740 --> 12:27.790
That's why we're working all night.

12:39.730 --> 12:40.820
Vash!

12:41.570 --> 12:44.750
Don't get taken in! Wake up!

12:47.530 --> 12:48.430
A "flower"?

12:48.430 --> 12:51.100
Yes. This one's a geranium.

12:51.100 --> 12:54.340
There were lots of other
 flowers back on Earth, too.

12:54.340 --> 12:55.950
Can you eat it?

12:55.950 --> 12:58.240
Not this kind, I'm afraid.

12:58.240 --> 13:01.660
So it's ornamental, right, Rem?

13:01.660 --> 13:03.750
Just like the one in the plant room.

13:05.630 --> 13:08.720
That's right, Nai. You're very observant.

13:10.640 --> 13:12.930
Too bad it's not edible...

13:12.930 --> 13:15.540
You're always thinking about eating.

13:15.540 --> 13:17.850
Well, sorry that's all I'm good for.

13:17.850 --> 13:19.160
That's not what I said.

13:19.160 --> 13:20.140
It's what you meant!

13:20.140 --> 13:20.940
What was that?

13:20.940 --> 13:23.150
Gosh, you're always bickering.

13:23.150 --> 13:26.520
Nai, just because you're 
the one with special powers—

13:26.520 --> 13:30.020
Yeah, yeah. It doesn't mean 
I should show off, right?

13:30.020 --> 13:34.330
The power you received is wonderful, 
but promise me this.

13:34.330 --> 13:36.560
When everyone wakes up from cryosleep—

13:36.560 --> 13:39.090
Never show it to anyone but you.

13:39.090 --> 13:41.130
And even if you don't need to—

13:41.130 --> 13:43.420
Pretend to eat and drink.

13:43.890 --> 13:45.260
I know.

13:47.670 --> 13:49.710
You should be more worried about Vash.

13:49.710 --> 13:52.530
At this rate, he'll really just be a human.

13:55.930 --> 14:00.210
That's fine. There's no need to
 compare yourself to anyone else.

14:00.210 --> 14:02.500
You are who you are, 
and that's all you need to be.

14:04.280 --> 14:06.700
You too, Nai. Come here.

14:08.110 --> 14:13.240
Powers or no powers, 
both you boys are still precious to me.

14:15.630 --> 14:17.160
I love you.

14:20.560 --> 14:23.870
This must have meant something to you, too.

14:23.870 --> 14:26.120
You really think so?

14:47.710 --> 14:49.560
This is bad, Nai.

14:49.560 --> 14:53.220
You have to be wondering
 what Rem is hiding, too.

15:09.490 --> 15:10.640
Me?

15:10.640 --> 15:12.000
And me, too.

15:14.460 --> 15:16.470
Project Code "Type T"?

15:17.050 --> 15:21.010
Another Independent like us 
was born on this ship...

15:21.010 --> 15:22.670
Fifty years ago.

15:22.670 --> 15:26.320
The records are being kept... here?

15:29.970 --> 15:31.340
H-Huh?

15:32.530 --> 15:33.340
What?

15:53.630 --> 15:55.290
Nai! Vash!

15:58.850 --> 16:01.900
I know that humans 
did terrible things to her.

16:02.470 --> 16:04.290
I understand why you'd hate them.

16:04.860 --> 16:06.300
But even so...

16:06.300 --> 16:08.550
You still don't get it?

16:08.550 --> 16:12.340
That was but one grain of sand.

16:34.020 --> 16:36.940
Humanity repeats the same tragedies.

16:37.640 --> 16:42.250
They deplore conflict, 
yet no era is ever free from war.

16:43.920 --> 16:45.910
History is proof.

16:47.830 --> 16:49.410
Reading that again?

16:50.630 --> 16:52.470
Humanity never learns.

16:55.450 --> 16:57.280
That's not true.

16:58.990 --> 17:00.780
Rem told me.

17:00.780 --> 17:05.690
When we were born, she vowed 
never to let that tragedy occur again.

17:06.300 --> 17:07.610
So...

17:07.610 --> 17:09.420
let's have faith in humanity.

17:19.650 --> 17:24.910
Without any powers, 
you're too weak to live as a plant.

17:24.910 --> 17:28.850
That's why you craved the
 love of humans over all else.

17:28.850 --> 17:34.020
You needed to smile, show your charm, 
and behave like a harmless pet.

17:34.930 --> 17:40.370
You'll never find happiness that way.
 I had to protect you.

17:40.370 --> 17:42.290
That's why I crashed the ships.

17:44.420 --> 17:46.420
It's my fault?

17:46.420 --> 17:48.630
I did it all for you.

18:07.340 --> 18:09.270
This is it! The final memory...

18:09.270 --> 18:12.070
Synchronization at 99 percent.

18:12.070 --> 18:13.610
Please, make it stop!

18:13.610 --> 18:15.000
It's not too late!

18:15.540 --> 18:19.500
It is indeed too late. 
About 150 years too late.

18:25.250 --> 18:26.420
Vash!

18:27.940 --> 18:29.330
Artillery fire?

18:29.680 --> 18:32.340
A giant unknown organism has appeared 
in the central tower! Need backup!

18:35.410 --> 18:36.840
What is that thing?

18:37.790 --> 18:39.840
We're so close...

18:43.100 --> 18:46.850
That woman was the cause 
of all the confusion.

18:47.420 --> 18:54.320
What you tried to believe was love, 
Vash, was just a bunch of excuses.

18:54.990 --> 18:57.320
Mere silly fantasies.

19:00.810 --> 19:02.950
No! Rem!

19:03.380 --> 19:05.950
Please! Don't leave me!

19:07.850 --> 19:09.600
I'll save you.

19:24.190 --> 19:26.530
Synchronization at 100 percent.

19:26.530 --> 19:30.390
Memory manipulation and
 assimilation complete.

19:36.300 --> 19:38.230
I've finally got him back!

19:43.930 --> 19:46.620
Happy birthday, Vash.

20:02.870 --> 20:05.000
Third connection successful.

20:05.450 --> 20:06.550
That's...

20:07.010 --> 20:09.050
the entrance to the higher plane!

20:30.620 --> 20:33.790
This is the Third City JuLai 
to the Alliance of Cities!

20:33.790 --> 20:35.440
Request immediate assistance!

20:35.440 --> 20:40.800
Flaming arrows will vaporize the cities, 
and a flood will purify the lands...

20:41.590 --> 20:43.820
Today is the battle of Har Megiddo.

20:58.360 --> 21:03.860
I'm going to enter the higher plane
 and directly touch the core.

21:04.310 --> 21:06.120
Be careful, Knives.

21:09.610 --> 21:10.580
You're...

21:12.030 --> 21:14.250
It's been a long journey.

21:15.020 --> 21:20.490
Until Knives realized his wishes, 
I was not even permitted death.

21:21.250 --> 21:23.440
But it'll all be over soon.

21:28.230 --> 21:33.390
The human race and its zealous 
assertion of dominance ends here.

21:55.240 --> 21:57.460
We Independents...

21:58.010 --> 22:03.200
will bring a new order to this world!

22:15.980 --> 22:19.980
#11 To a New World

22:19.980 --> 22:27.600
<i>Your light...</i>

22:34.060 --> 22:38.360
<i>If that light never changes</i>

22:38.360 --> 22:42.790
<i>And continues to shine high above the sky</i>

22:42.790 --> 22:47.100
<i>Even when I'm lost, 
even when I'm struggling</i>

22:47.100 --> 22:51.350
<i>I'll continue to search for you</i>

22:51.350 --> 22:55.640
<i>Even on days of sickness or sadness</i>

22:55.640 --> 23:00.020
<i>I'll open the window to a new morning</i>

23:00.020 --> 23:04.210
<i>I'm moving forward, I'm standing still</i>

23:04.210 --> 23:07.770
<i>Tell the people who are praying</i>

23:07.770 --> 23:13.730
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:13.730 --> 23:16.740
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:16.740 --> 23:19.460
<i>Yes, I'm reaching out</i>

23:19.460 --> 23:24.800
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>

23:24.800 --> 23:30.770
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:30.770 --> 23:33.920
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:33.920 --> 23:36.620
<i>Yes, I try to reach out</i>

23:36.620 --> 23:41.780
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>
